  "// _README": [
    "── 301 MATERIAL REDIRECT MAP ──",
    "Source of truth: MATERIAL_SLUG_MAP in src/pages/products/product-entities/[...slug].astro",
    "",
    "Problem: Product detail pages (Related Knowledge section) previously linked to",
    "  /products/materials/{content-slug}/  which is a NON-EXISTENT route.",
    "  The correct path is: /materials/{page-slug}/",
    "",
    "This file lists all known broken URL patterns → correct destination.",
    "",
    "Usage:",
    "  Option A — Astro config (SSG→Netlify/Vercel):",
    "    Copy these entries into astro.config.mjs → redirects: {} or your host's _redirects file.",
    "",
    "  Option B — Nginx:",
    "    generate rewrite rules:  rewrite ^/products/materials/(.+)/$ /materials/$1 permanent;",
    "",
    "  Option C — Netlify _redirects:",
    "    /products/materials/*  /materials/:splat  301!",
    "",
    "Last updated: 2026-07-29 (after code fix removing broken links from product pages)",
